{"unit_id":"pipipigu__dsh-workspace-tree#card-zh","repo":"pipipigu/dsh-workspace-tree","commit":"ba54918312313e7ce423fd35631bc887acf781c1","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-workspace-tree 是面向 DSH Web 的工作区与会话整理插件。它替换侧边栏的工作区列表，并通过本机 HTTP 接口读写各工作区的树形元数据。你可以创建、改名和着色虚拟文件夹，把会话移动或置顶，在文件夹内新建会话，并浏览本机目录来添加工作区。插件还会扫描工作区中的嵌套子项目，支持隐藏目录显示和新建目录。适合需要按项目整理多个工作区、快速定位会话的 DSH 用户。无需 API 密钥或外部账号；元数据保存在工作区的 .dsh/workspace-tree.json 中，目录选择器会访问本机文件夹。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.tsx:13-22","src/client/tree-store.ts:79-223","src/plugin/http.ts:69-151","src/plugin/storage.ts:9-75"]}
{"unit_id":"pipipigu__dsh-workspace-tree#card-en","repo":"pipipigu/dsh-workspace-tree","commit":"ba54918312313e7ce423fd35631bc887acf781c1","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-workspace-tree organizes DSH Web workspaces with virtual session folders. It replaces the sidebar list, stores metadata locally, and lets users move or pin sessions and start chats in folders. The picker browses or creates folders and detects nested projects. No API key or account is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.tsx:13-22","src/client/tree-store.ts:79-223","src/plugin/http.ts:69-151","src/plugin/storage.ts:9-75"]}
